  "description": "Installation of 1No. BT Street Hub Unit including illuminated advertisement display.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-aac53f9e-7fff-e47a-ac17-a5807d50058f&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.38;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;padding:0pt 5pt 0pt 5pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposed structure, by reason of its scale, location and illumination, would result in an incongruous form of street clutter that would have an intrusive impact, to the detriment of the character and appearance of the application site and surrounding streetscape. The proposal is therefore contrary to D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach) of the London Plan (2021); Policies LP1 (Design) and LP7 (Advertisement) of the adopted Hackney Local Plan (2020) and guidance under the NPPF. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
